比|to compare; than; ratio|比较|bǐjiào|fairly; quite; to compare|今天比昨天暖和。|Jīntiān bǐ zuótiān nuǎnhuo.|Today is warmer than yesterday.|Two people standing side by side to compare their height.
过|to pass; to cross; experienced action marker|过来|guòlái|to come over|你去过长城吗？|Nǐ qùguo Chángchéng ma?|Have you ever been to the Great Wall?|Walking (辶) past a checkpoint measured by the inch (寸) to cross over.
长|long; length|长城|Chángchéng|the Great Wall|这条河非常长。|Zhè tiáo hé fēicháng cháng.|This river is very long.|Flowing hair stretching out long and trailing in the wind.
病|illness; sickness; to fall ill|生病|shēngbìng|to get sick; to fall ill|他今天生病了，没去上班。|Tā jīntiān shēngbìng le, méi qù shàngbān.|He fell ill today and did not go to work.|Resting on a sickbed (疒) while a fever burns like fire (丙) inside.
课|class; lesson; course|上课|shàngkè|to attend class|我们早上八点开始上课。|Wǒmen zǎoshang bā diǎn kāishǐ shàngkè.|We start class at eight in the morning.|Words (讠) that bear fruit (果) of knowledge in every school lesson.
晚|evening; night; late|晚上|wǎnshang|evening; night|你今天晚上有空吗？|Nǐ jīntiān wǎnshang yǒu kòng ma?|Are you free this evening?|As the sun (日) slips away (免) below the horizon, evening arrives.
包|bag; package; to wrap; bun|书包|shūbāo|schoolbag; backpack|我的书包里有三本书。|Wǒ de shūbāo lǐ yǒu sān běn shū.|There are three books in my schoolbag.|An outer wrapper curling around to enclose and hold something safely inside.
玩|to play; to have fun; to enjoy|好玩|hǎowán|fun; interesting; amusing|孩子们在公园里玩得很开心。|Háizimen zài gōngyuán lǐ wán de hěn kāixīn.|The children are playing happily in the park.|Holding a smooth jade trinket (王) in your hand to play with and enjoy (元).
班|class; work shift; team|上班|shàngbān|to go to work; to be on duty|我爸爸每天坐地铁去上班。|Wǒ bàba měitiān zuò dìtiě qù shàngbān.|My dad takes the subway to work every day.|Dividing two pieces of jade (王) with a marker in the middle to assign each group to its class or shift.
它|it (for animals and things)|它们|tāmen|they; them (for things/animals)|这是一只小猫，它很喜欢喝牛奶。|Zhè shì yì zhī xiǎomāo, tā hěn xǐhuan hē niúnǎi.|This is a kitten; it really likes drinking milk.|A small creature curled up peacefully under a shelter roof (宀).
外|outside; foreign; external|外面|wàimiàn|outside|外面风很大，请关上门。|Wàimiàn fēng hěn dà, qǐng guānshàng mén.|The wind is very strong outside; please close the door.|Looking out at the evening moon (夕) beyond the divination line (卜) on the outside.
吧|suggestion or softening particle|走吧|zǒu ba|let's go|时间不早了，我们回家吧。|Shíjiān bù zǎo le, wǒmen huíjiā ba.|It is getting late; let's go home.|A friendly mouth (口) adding a gentle tone (巴) to make a warm suggestion.
白|white; clear; bright; in vain|白色|báisè|white color|她穿了一件白色的毛衣。|Tā chuānle yí jiàn báisè de máoyī.|She is wearing a white sweater.|A bright ray of light rising above the rising sun (日), shining pure white.
唱|to sing; to call out|唱歌|chànggē|to sing a song|她非常喜欢唱歌。|Tā fēicháng xǐhuan chànggē.|She really likes singing songs.|An open mouth (口) singing as brightly and clearly as two shining suns (昌).
市|city; market; municipality|超市|chāoshì|supermarket|周末我们去超市买东西。|Zhōumò wǒmen qù chāoshì mǎi dōngxi.|On the weekend we go to the supermarket to buy things.|A central market tower (亠) hanging a cloth sign (巾) where city traders gather.
超|to exceed; super-; to overtake|超市|chāoshì|supermarket|这家超市的水果很新鲜。|Zhè jiā chāoshì de shuǐguǒ hěn xīnxiān.|The fruit at this supermarket is very fresh.|Running (走) swiftly when called (召) to leap ahead and surpass others.
穿|to wear; to put on; to pass through|穿衣服|chuān yīfu|to wear or put on clothes|今天你要穿哪件外套？|Jīntiān nǐ yào chuān nǎ jiàn wàitào?|Which coat are you going to wear today?|Pushing clean through an opening (穴) like a tooth (牙) slipping through a sleeve.
到|to arrive; to reach; up to|到了|dào le|have arrived; is here|我们已经到飞机场了。|Wǒmen yǐjīng dào fēijīchǎng le.|We have already arrived at the airport.|An arrow reaching (至) its final mark with the sharp precision of a blade (刂).
第|ordinal prefix (first, second...)|第一|dì-yī|first; number one|这是我第一次来北京。|Zhè shì wǒ dì-yī cì lái Běijīng.|This is my first time coming to Beijing.|Bamboo slips (⺮) tied in neat order along a winding cord (弟) to mark first, second, and third.
弟|younger brother|弟弟|dìdi|younger brother|我弟弟今年上小学。|Wǒ dìdi jīnnián shàng xiǎoxué.|My younger brother started elementary school this year.|A younger boy wrapped neatly in a sash with two playful horns at the top.
房|house; room; building|房间|fángjiān|room|他的新房子离学校很近。|Tā de xīn fángzi lí xuéxiào hěn jìn.|His new house is very close to the school.|A household door (户) opening into a square (方) living space.
常|often; usually; common|非常|fēicháng|very; extremely|我周末常常去图书馆看书。|Wǒ zhōumò chángcháng qù túshūguǎn kànshū.|I often go to the library to read on weekends.|A banner cloth (巾) hanging steadily under a high pavilion roof all year round.
非|not; non-; must (with 不)|非常|fēicháng|very; extremely|这道菜做得非常好吃。|Zhè dào cài zuò de fēicháng hǎochī.|This dish is cooked extraordinarily well.|Two wings spreading in opposite directions, refusing to go the same way.
歌|song; to sing|唱歌|chànggē|to sing a song|这首中文歌很好听。|Zhè shǒu Zhōngwén gē hěn hǎotīng.|This Chinese song sounds very nice.|Two melodic phrases (哥) followed by an open breath (欠) as you sing a song.
司|to manage; department; company|公司|gōngsī|company; firm|他在一家电脑公司工作。|Tā zài yì jiā diànnǎo gōngsī gōngzuò.|He works at a computer company.|An official speaking (口) from behind a command screen to manage affairs.
贵|expensive; noble; precious|太贵了|tài guì le|too expensive|这双鞋子太贵了。|Zhè shuāng xiézi tài guì le.|This pair of shoes is too expensive.|A basket full of precious cowrie shells (贝), the ancient symbol of high value and expense.
蛋|egg|鸡蛋|jīdàn|chicken egg|我早饭吃了一个鸡蛋。|Wǒ zǎofàn chīle yí gè jīdàn.|I ate an egg for breakfast.|A smooth oval egg laid safely underneath a coiled creature (虫).
鸡|chicken|鸡蛋|jīdàn|chicken egg|奶奶在院子里养了几只鸡。|Nǎinai zài yuànzi lǐ yǎngle jǐ zhī jī.|Grandma raises a few chickens in the courtyard.|A hand (又) feeding a domesticated bird (鸟) in the farmyard.
件|measure word for clothes, matters, items|一件衣服|yí jiàn yīfu|a piece of clothing|我昨天买了一件新衬衫。|Wǒ zuótiān mǎile yí jiàn xīn chènshān.|I bought a new shirt yesterday.|A person (亻) counting items one by one beside an ox (牛).
得|complement particle; to get; to obtain|觉得|juéde|to feel; to think|你觉得这本书有意思吗？|Nǐ juéde zhè běn shū yǒuyìsi ma?|Do you think this book is interesting?|Stepping out (彳) under the morning sun (旦) to measure and gain (寸) what you seek.
零|zero; fragment; remainder|零下|língxià|below zero|今天温度是零下五度。|Jīntiān wēndù shì língxià wǔ dù.|The temperature today is five degrees below zero.|Gentle raindrops (雨) falling on command (令) until nothing is left but zero.
卖|to sell|卖东西|mài dōngxi|to sell things|这家书店卖很多外文书。|Zhè jiā shūdiàn mài hěn duō wàiwén shū.|This bookstore sells many foreign-language books.|Putting a plus sign (十) on top of "buy" (买) means offering goods out for sale.
忙|busy; hurried|很忙|hěn máng|very busy|你最近工作忙不忙？|Nǐ zuìjìn gōngzuò máng bu máng?|Have you been busy with work lately?|When your heart (忄) feels like time is slipping away (亡), you are terribly busy.
妹|younger sister|妹妹|mèimei|younger sister|我妹妹喜欢画画儿。|Wǒ mèimei xǐhuan huàhuàr.|My younger sister likes drawing pictures.|A young girl (女) who is not yet (未) fully grown is your younger sister.
您|you (polite, singular)|您好|nín hǎo|hello (polite)|老师，您好！请问您找谁？|Lǎoshī, nín hǎo! Qǐngwèn nín zhǎo shuí?|Hello, Teacher! May I ask who you are looking for?|Placing "you" (你) respectfully right above your own heart (心) to show polite esteem.
奶|milk; grandmother; breast|牛奶|niúnǎi|cow's milk|每天早上喝牛奶对身体好。|Měitiān zǎoshang hē niúnǎi duì shēntǐ hǎo.|Drinking milk every morning is good for your health.|A mother or grandmother (女) leaning gently (乃) to nourish a child with warm milk.
牛|cow; ox; cattle; awesome|牛奶|niúnǎi|cow's milk|草地上有几头牛。|Cǎodì shàng yǒu jǐ tóu niú.|There are several cows on the grassland.|A sturdy ox head with curved horns rising up on top.
士|scholar; professional; soldier|女士|nǚshì|lady; Madam; Ms.|那位女士是我们的经理。|Nà wèi nǚshì shì wǒmen de jīnglǐ.|That lady is our manager.|Ten (十) things learned and mastered on a solid base (一) make a trained professional.
便|convenient (in 方便); cheap (in 便宜)|方便|fāngbiàn|convenient|坐地铁去市中心很方便。|Zuò dìtiě qù shìzhōngxīn hěn fāngbiàn.|Taking the subway to the city center is very convenient.|A person (亻) making a quick change (更) to make life easier and more convenient.
宜|suitable; proper; cheap (in 便宜)|便宜|piányi|cheap; inexpensive|这家店的水果又好吃又便宜。|Zhè jiā diàn de shuǐguǒ yòu hǎochī yòu piányi.|The fruit at this shop is both delicious and cheap.|Placing dishes neatly on a rack (且) under a home roof (宀) where everything is just right.
床|bed; couch|起床|qǐchuáng|to get up from bed|弟弟还在床上睡觉。|Dìdi hái zài chuáng shàng shuìjiào.|My younger brother is still sleeping in bed.|A wooden (木) frame placed inside a spacious shelter (广) to rest and sleep on.
千|thousand|一千|yìqiān|one thousand|这个学校有两千名学生。|Zhège xuéxiào yǒu liǎngqiān míng xuésheng.|This school has two thousand students.|A sweeping stroke atop ten (十) multiplying the count all the way to a thousand.
手|hand; person skilled in something|手机|shǒujī|mobile phone; cell phone|吃饭以前要先洗手。|Chīfàn yǐqián yào xiān xǐshǒu.|You should wash your hands first before eating.|An open palm with fingers spreading out from the central wrist line.
题|topic; question; exam problem; title|问题|wèntí|question; problem|老师，我有一个问题。|Lǎoshī, wǒ yǒu yí gè wèntí.|Teacher, I have a question.|Looking right (是) at the main heading at the top of a page (页).
新|new; fresh; up-to-date|新年|xīnnián|New Year|祝大家新年快乐！|Zhù dàjiā Xīnnián kuàilè!|Wishing everyone a Happy New Year!|Using an axe (斤) to cut fresh wood from a standing tree (亲) to build something brand new.
息|breath; news; to rest|休息|xiūxi|to rest; to take a break|工作累了就休息一会儿吧。|Gōngzuò lèi le jiù xiūxi yíhuìr ba.|Take a short rest if you are tired from work.|Drawing a quiet breath through your nose (自) straight down into your calm heart (心).
元|unit of currency (yuan); first; primary|十元|shí yuán|ten yuan|这本书一共二十元。|Zhè běn shū yígòng èrshí yuán.|This book is twenty yuan in total.|Two (二) horizontal lines supported by walking legs (儿), standing as the primary unit.
真|real; true; really; indeed|真好|zhēn hǎo|really good; wonderful|你今天做的菜真好吃！|Nǐ jīntiān zuò de cài zhēn hǎochī!|The food you cooked today is truly delicious!|Measuring carefully with your eyes (目) on a stand (八) to see what is genuinely true.
知|to know; to be aware of; knowledge|知道|zhīdào|to know; to be aware of|你知道他的电话号码吗？|Nǐ zhīdào tā de diànhuà hàomǎ ma?|Do you know his phone number?|Speaking (口) as swiftly and accurately as a flying arrow (矢) shows true knowledge.
道|road; way; method; to know (in 知道)|知道|zhīdào|to know|我不知道他住在哪里。|Wǒ bù zhīdào tā zhù zài nǎlǐ.|I do not know where he lives.|Using your head (首) to lead the way as you walk (辶) along the right path.
饺|dumpling (jiaozi)|饺子|jiǎozi|Chinese dumplings|过年的时候我们一起包饺子。|Guònián de shíhou wǒmen yìqǐ bāo jiǎozi.|We wrap dumplings together during Chinese New Year.|Delicious food (饣) folded and crossed (交) neatly at the edges into a crescent dumpling.
呼|to call out; to breathe out; to address|称呼|chēnghu|to address; form of address|请问我应该怎么称呼您？|Qǐngwèn wǒ yīnggāi zěnme chēnghu nín?|May I ask how I should address you?|An open mouth (口) letting out a long breath (乎) to call out to someone.
称|to call; to address; to weigh|称呼|chēnghu|to address; title|大家都很喜欢这个称呼。|Dàjiā dōu hěn xǐhuan zhège chēnghu.|Everyone really likes this form of address.|Lifting a bundle of grain (禾) with your hand (尔) to weigh it and give it the right name.
